      mechanism of the hosting platform is expressly permitted and is not a
      breach of this clause; what it does not grant is the right to publish a
      product, a service or a release built from that fork;

   b) use the Software, or any part of it, in a product or a service, whether
      commercial or free;

   c) create and distribute a derivative work of the Software;

   d) remove or alter this licence, the copyright notices, or the security
